title: "gemini-reliability-proxy"
abstract: >-
  Treats an unreliable LLM like infrastructure: a zero-dependency Gemini proxy core with
  model fallback chains, 429-versus-5xx-aware retry, chain-wide time budgets, and
  denial-of-wallet limits.
